:null,"time":{"year":184,"label":"中平元年三月甲子","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"sunshi-y184","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"sunshi-q-o004","basis":"中平元年三月甲子"},"evidence":["sunshi-e-o004a-q","sunshi-q-o004","sunshi-q-b-20009ada2a277ad4d7bd"]},"ordering_evidence":"sunshi-e-o004a-q","source_order":[46,5,"O004a"],"order":8005},{"id":"sunshi-e-p004a","title":"张角张宝张梁各称将军","accounts":[{"id":"sunshi-e-p004a-account","label":"《献帝春秋》","text":"张角张宝张梁各称将军","evidence":["sunshi-e-p004a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0006","role":"称号","evidence":["sunshi-e-p004a-q"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0009","role":"称号","evidence":["sunshi-e-p004a-q"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0010","role":"称号","evidence":["sunshi-e-p004a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"黄巾起事时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["sunshi-e-p004a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"sunshi-e-p004a-q","source_order":[46,46,"P004a"],"order":8014}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0006","name":"张角","evidence":["sunshi-q-o004","huanchen-q-c275ea9b9b51e2f6fc28","gongsuntao-q-17bf7b17b9e88027545e","gongsuntao-q-55da15fb198335aa2dd3","gongsuntao-q-4ffa990601d3e35a91ec","gongsuntao-q-85b2e759fe3bfecb2361"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"sunshi-m-o004-sunshi-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-o004"]},{"id":"sunshi-m-p004-sunshi-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-p004"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-17bf7b17b9e88027545e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-9bdc891e043888f35a7b","layer":"pei","quote":"张角之反也，黑山、白波、黄龙、左校、牛角、五鹿、羝根、苦蝤、刘石、平汉、大洪、司隶、缘城、罗市、雷公、浮云、飞燕、白爵、杨凤、于毒等，各起兵，大者二三万，小者不减数千。灵帝不能讨，乃遣使拜杨凤为黑山校尉，领诸山贼，得举孝廉、计吏。后遂弥漫，不可复数","attribution":"裴注·九州春秋","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0b4fdbd0432367e810","start":12,"end":136},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-4ffa990601d3e35a91ec","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-4ac971e2af4b20f17ba7","layer":"pei","quote":"太平道者，师持九节杖为符祝，教病人叩头思过，因以符水饮之。得病或日浅而愈者，则云此人信道；其或不愈，则为不信道","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0ac770e5b8c2b604ba38","start":62,"end":117},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-55da15fb198335aa2dd3","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-4ac971e2af4b20f17ba7","layer":"pei","quote":"熹平中，妖贼大起，三辅有骆曜；光和中，东方有张角，汉中有张脩。骆曜教民缅匿法，角为太平道，脩为五斗米道","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0ac770e5b8c2b604ba38","start":10,"end":61},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-85b2e759fe3bfecb2361","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-4ac971e2af4b20f17ba7","layer":"pei","quote":"后角被诛，脩亦亡。及鲁在汉中，因其民信行脩业，遂增饰之：教使作义舍，以米肉置其中，以止行人；又教使自隐，有小过者，当治道百步，则罪除；又依月令，春夏禁杀；又禁酒：流移寄在其地者，不敢不奉","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0ac770e5b8c2b604ba38","start":278,"end":371},{"id":"huanchen-q-c275ea9b9b51e2f6fc28","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"张角起，以植为北中郎将，征角失利，抵罪。顷之，复以为尚书","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":102,"end":130},{"id":"sunshi-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-44742023851273b5aeac","layer":"original","quote":"中平元年〖17〗，黄巾贼帅张角起于魏郡〖18〗。托有神灵，遣八使以善道教化天下〖19〗；而潜相连结，自称“黄天泰平”。三月甲子〖20〗，三十六（万）〔方〕一旦俱发〖21〗，天下响应；燔烧郡县，杀害长吏〖22〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108},{"id":"sunshi-e-p004a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-ca84335aa71415687249","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《献帝春秋》曰：“角称‘天公将军’；角弟宝，称‘地公将军’；宝弟梁，称‘人公将军’。”","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4b52d19d0c3397d430bf","start":0,"end":46},{"id":"sunshi-q-b-20009ada2a277ad4d7bd","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-20009ada2a277ad4d7bd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗中平元年：公元 184 年。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-76a050106a9c5f0df77e","start":0,"end":18},{"id":"sunshi-q-o004","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-44742023851273b5aeac","layer":"original","quote":"中平元年〖17〗，黄巾贼帅张角起于魏郡〖18〗。托有神灵，遣八使以善道教化天下〖19〗；而潜相连结，自称“黄天泰平”。三月甲子〖20〗，三十六（万）〔方〕一旦俱发〖21〗，天下响应；燔烧郡县，杀害长吏〖22〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108},{"id":"sunshi-q-p004","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-ca84335aa71415687249","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《献帝春秋》曰：“角称‘天公将军’；角弟宝，称‘地公将军’；宝弟梁，称‘人公将军’。”","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4b52d19d0c3397d430bf","start":0,"end":46}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
